      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the spawned child process\u0027s environment immediately before that process starts**. Specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent (or Query agent) child process\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated or holds the key\n- This ensures that a compromised Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables\u2014the key exists only in the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API",
